---
/** Persistent demo/concept notice. Required on every page (see CLAUDE.md, README). */
---
<div class="demo" role="note">
  <p>
    Concept site. <strong>MYPC is not a real organization.</strong> Names, imagery,
    events and contact details are placeholders.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .demo {
    min-height: var(--demo-h);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.35rem var(--gutter);
    background: var(--color-navy-950);
    color: var(--color-gold-300);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .demo p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .demo strong {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
